 outhern Finger Lakes (The ARTS Council) is pleased to announce that In You
 r Backyard\, a solo exhibition by Kate Buzzell\, will be on view from Mond
 ay\, August 31\, to Friday\, October 2\, 2026.\nAn opening reception will 
 be held on Thursday\, September 3\, from 5 to 7pm at The ARTS Council\,79 
 West Market St. in Corning\, NY. Join us at 6pm for an artist talk with Ka
 te.\nTo find out more about Kate and In Your Backyard\, visit: https://www
 .earts.org/in-the-gallery/current-exhibit/\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:
 //calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78434989/20260903170000
