BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Steuben 250 Concert & History Fair | Pulteney Square\, Bath
DTSTART:20260905T130000Z
DTEND:20260905T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260904T133027Z
UID:5a634895c632f99e5d577809ece257bf2326a801@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:History & Heritage,Community,Festivals,Family Fun,Music,Food
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 250 Years of America and Steuben County's Place in H
 istory! -- Join us as we honor the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of
  Independence and commemorate the vital role Steuben County has played in 
 our nation's story. This full-day celebration will feature music\, history
  displays\, Revolutionary and Civil War re-enactors\, and lots of fun!\nTh
 is event is being sponsored by the New York State 250th Commemoration Comm
 ittee "Empowering Local Partners" Grant\nCo-Organizers: Steuben County His
 torian and Steuben County Historical Society.\nEvent Details:\n- Sing Demo
 cracy 250 by the Cantata Singers\n- Mark Twain Barbershop Singers\n- The F
 our Tunes\n- St. Thomas Bell Choir\n- Corning Brassworks\n- Brad Ordway\n-
  Thomas Jefferson\, Benjamin Franklin\, and the Publick Universal Friend w
 ill be stopping by!\n- Revolutionary & Civil War Reenactors\n••• Hoi
 sington's Rangers\n••• 24th Connecticut Militia\n••• Squires B
 attery\n••• First New York Dragoons\n••• 7th Ohio Dismounted C
 avalry\n••• Historical Military Surgery\n- History Fair w/ Museum an
 d Historical Society displays\n- Food Trucks\nEvent by Steuben Historian a
 nd Will Wickham\nPulteney Square\n8 E Morris St\, Bath\n\nSource: FLXcalen
 dar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78456570/20260905090000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78456570/20260905090000
END:VEVENT
