SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Music,Festivals,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:YOUR FAVORITE ALT-ROCK + 2000s ANTHEMS. LIVE IN ELMIRA.\nIntro
 ducing ELMIRA ALT-ROCK FEST\, happening Saturday\, September 5 at Elmira C
 ountry Club!\nOne full day. SEVEN artists and bands. Tickets starting at j
 ust $25\nHEADLINING THE FEST:\nTONIC — FULL BAND\nRYAN KEY OF YELLOWCARD
  — SPECIAL ACOUSTIC SET\nSTEPHEN CHRISTIAN OF ANBERLIN — SPECIAL ACOUS
 TIC SET\nPLUS FULL-BAND PERFORMANCES FROM:\nJet Black Maps\nMAGENTANYS\nSe
 cond Suitor\nBurden My Surrender\nFrom Tonic favorites like “If You Coul
 d Only See” to the songs that defined the 2000s from Yellowcard and Anbe
 rlin\, Elmira Alt-Rock Fest brings generations of alternative rock\, pop-p
 unk and punk together for one full day of live music.\nHear Ryan Key perfo
 rm songs from Yellowcard in a special acoustic set\, including fan favorit
 es like “Ocean Avenue” and “Only One.”\nStephen Christian brings t
 he songs of Anberlin to the stage with a special acoustic performance feat
 uring music from the band’s catalog\, including favorites like “Feel G
 ood Drag\,” “Paperthin Hymn” and “Never Take Friendship Personal.
 ”\nThen TONIC hits the stage as a FULL BAND as part of an expanded natio
 nal lineup.\nSEVEN ARTISTS + BANDS.\nONE FULL DAY OF LIVE MUSIC.\nTICKETS 
 STARTING AT $25.\nAnd yes\, this event is at Elmira Country Club.\nNo golf
  required.\nNo country club membership required.\nElmira Alt-Rock Fest is 
 OPEN TO EVERYONE.\nEVENT DETAILS\nSaturday\, September 5\, 2026\nDoors Ope
 n: 1:00 PM\nLive Music: 1:30 PM–9:00 PM\nElmira Country Club\n1538 West 
 Church Street\nElmira\, NY 14905\nGeneral Admission + Front-of-Stage Pit T
 ickets Available\nAll Ages\nFree Parking\nElmira Alt-Rock Fest benefits th
 e FOREVER2SIX Fund\, supporting Donate Life\, and the Elmira Aviators.\nTI
 CKETS + COMPLETE EVENT DETAILS:\nhttps://lecomeventcenter.com/events/elmir
 a-alt-rock-fest\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj
 /event/78429461/20260905130000
GEO:42.087516;-76.84687
LOCATION:Elmira Country Club\, 1538 West Church Street\, Elmira\, New York
 \, 14905\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78429461/20260905130000
END:VEVENT
