DTEND:20260912T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260904T133027Z
UID:e02462c520c4d696f885a68dc4c466b641a4088c@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Cars,Community,History & Heritage
DESCRIPTION:Since 1993\, the Watkins Glen Grand Prix Festival\, presented 
 by Chemung Canal Trust Company\, has revved up our village\, celebrating a
  legacy of speed and soul. This year\, we’re celebrating American muscle
  in all its glory. The 2026 Featured Marque is the Chevrolet Camaro and Po
 ntiac Firebird!\nFestival Highlights to look forward to:\n-The Walk of Fam
 e Award Ceremony\n-"The Legends Speak"\n-Pre-Race Tech Inspection at Small
 ey's Garage\n-Stone Bridge Driver Car Displays: Featuring over 600 classic
  sports cars!\n-Fuel up with the best flavors of the Finger Lakes with loc
 al food trucks and vendors\n-Explore local shops on Franklin Street in bet
 ween events\n-Hear the roar as our drivers tear through the Oirignal Grand
  Prix Circuit!\n-End the day with live music and local eats!\nWe can't wai
 t to see you all this September!\nEvent by Watkins Glen Grand Prix Festiva
 l and Watkins Glen Promotions\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.ti
 me.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78456580/20260911100000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78456580/20260911100000
END:VEVENT
