 w art lovers and community members. Music will be performed in the Upstair
 s Gallery by harpist Meredith Kohn Bocek. Featured Artists Trish Coonrod\,
  Tom Gardner\, Christina Johnson\, and Jennifer Miler will be in attendanc
 e.\nThis is a family friendly event. Anyone who has not yet visited the Ga
 llery is highly encouraged to attend this event\, which is free and open t
 o the public. We hope you can join us!\nENJOY ONLINE! The exhibit will deb
 ut online by 11am on Opening Day\, 9/11/26: www.WestEndGallery.net.\nOIL P
