 umes!\nOur FIRST costume fitting for the 70th Annual Downtown Elmira Holid
 ay Parade is happening Sunday\, September 3rd from 9am-11am at the Pole Ba
 rn at 717 Dickinson St.\nWe’ve got over 300 costumes ready and waiting f
 or volunteers! Several floats that groups or families can sponsor!\nWant t
 o be part of this beloved Elmira tradition that’s been bringing holiday 
 cheer since 1956? Now’s your chance to help us create the magic and brin
 g smiles to the kiddos lining the streets.\nIf you’re interested in volu
 nteering in this year’s parade\, or have any general questions\, stop by
  the fitting to find your costume and learn more.\nLocation: The Pole Barn
 \, 717 Dickinson St. Elmira NY\n(Directions: Turn off Clemens onto 5th St
 \, then take the second left onto Dickinson St.)\nThe Downtown Elmira 70th
  Annual Holiday Parade\, sponsored by Community Bank\, N.A. and steps off 
