CATEGORIES:Music,Wine
DESCRIPTION:Event by Atwater Wine\nAtwater Wine\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nS
 arah Noell is a singer-songwriter based in Ithaca\, New York. Her folk son
 gs are meditative and carefully crafted\, with influences ranging from cla
 ssic country artists\, like Lucinda Williams\, to modern folk songwriters 
 like Angel Olsen.\nPlease join us for Sarah's music\, wine by the glass or
