BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Bodyguard: The Musical
DTSTART:20261020T233000Z
DTEND:20261021T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20260904T133027Z
UID:d2c61394c931c3318f80c131754440d17ba1a51c@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Music
DESCRIPTION:Event by Clemens Center\n207 Clemens Center Pkwy\nElmira\, NY
 \nPublic\nThe M&T Bank 2025-26 Broadway Season presents\nThe Bodyguard\nTu
 esday-Wednesday\, October 20-21\, 2026\, @ 7:30pm\nSeason tickets on sale 
 now at ClemensCenter.org\nIndividual tickets will be on sale at a later da
 te\n---------------\nBased on the 1992 film starring Whitney Houston and K
 evin Costner\, THE BODYGUARD is a thrilling\, romantic musical that combin
 es high-stakes suspense with unforgettable music. Former Secret Service ag
 ent turned bodyguard\, Frank Farmer\, is hired to protect superstar Rachel
  Marron from an unknown stalker. Both expect to be in charge of their situ
